0..71 Comment "/// This source transports `true` along the negation composite at three"
72..121 Comment "/// lengths of cctt\'s `tests/bench/negPath.cctt`."
122..125 Comment "///"
126..201 Comment "/// The composite at `n` holds `n + 1` negation paths, so an even `n` moves"
202..279 Comment "/// `true` to `false`. A path between types runs as its two maps. So each run"
280..337 Comment "/// applies negation once for each path of the composite."
338..341 Comment "///"
342..420 Comment "/// The run machine runs each length that this source states. At 10⁶ the run"
421..448 Comment "/// spends its fuel budget."
449..452 Comment "///"
453..469 Comment "/// - see: #6309"
470..515 Comment "/// - see: #6325 — the fuel budget at 10⁶"
